---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 15px
    fontFamily: "Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
  mindmap:
    padding: 10
---
mindmap
  root(("**TripShield**<br/>travel decision<br/>engine"))

    ("**1 · Decisive Buy Window**<br/>*kept — attacks deliberation time*")
      ("LLM link importer<br/>TikTok · Instagram · blogs")
        ("Extracts flight, hotel<br/>and attraction into<br/>structured itinerary data")
        ("Fallback: manual entry<br/>when extraction fails")
      ("Interactive itinerary cards")
      ("Price risk meter<br/>+ countdown lock")
        ("Deadline is **shared**, so the<br/>whole group sees the timer")
        ("Wait vs Buy simulator")
      ("Deep links to<br/>Skyscanner · Booking.com")
        ("We stop at checkout —<br/>no payment licensing")

    ("**2 · Swipe-and-Lock Consensus**<br/>*kept — breaks group deadlock*")
      ("60-second Travel DNA<br/>swipe deck")
        ("Pace · budget sensitivity<br/>morning vs night · food")
        ("Answers stay **private**<br/>so quiet members still count")
      ("Constraint-satisfaction<br/>algorithm")
        ("Preferences become constraints,<br/>not votes")
        ("Works with partial input")
      ("Deadlock breaker<br/>group maximizer")
      ("Want / maybe / skip<br/>tallies per option")

    ("**3 · Adaptive Ledger**<br/>*kept — money without the awkwardness*")
      ("OCR receipt scanning")
        ("Line-item splitting")
        ("Uneven tax allocation")
      ("Reactive ledger<br/>math engine")
        ("Real-time net IOUs<br/>balance tracker")
        ("Settlement status<br/>and timing")
      ("Automatic daily<br/>spend rebalancing")
        ("Overspend on Day 1 rewrites<br/>targets for Days 2–5")
        ("Strategies: balanced ·<br/>activity-aware · strict saving")

    ("**4 · Self-Healing Pivot**<br/>*kept — most defensible feature*")
      ("Live trip health<br/>score 0–100")
        ("Below 50 = plan is broken")
        ("80+ = optimal")
      ("One-tap alternative<br/>timeline rerouting")
        ("Old vs new day-by-day diff")
        ("Per-stop live weather<br/>and route previews")
      ("What-If simulator")
        ("Rehearse a disruption<br/>*before* it happens")
      ("B2B local merchant<br/>demand matching")
        ("Reroute into partners with<br/>unsold same-day capacity")
        ("This is the revenue model")

    ("**Ideas we dropped**<br/>*and why*")
      ("AI travel chatbot<br/>→ reintroduces open-ended<br/>deliberation")
      ("Traveller social network<br/>→ needs network effects")
      ("Gamified bucket list<br/>→ no link to the decision loop")
      ("Full booking engine / OTA<br/>→ licensing and inventory")
      ("AR city navigation<br/>→ orthogonal to the problem")
      ("Solo safety companion<br/>→ different user, different product")
      ("Carbon footprint scorer<br/>→ folded in as a future metric")
      ("Group chat with polls<br/>→ this **is** the status quo")

    ("**How we build it**")
      ("Expo SDK 57 ·<br/>React Native 0.86")
        ("One codebase, iOS + Android")
        ("Reviewers run it via QR<br/>in Expo Go")
      ("TypeScript")
        ("Ledger math needs<br/>static types")
      ("Gemini behind a<br/>serverless proxy")
        ("Key never ships<br/>in the client")
      ("Open-Meteo · keyless")
      ("ArcGIS static maps ·<br/>keyless")
      ("Supabase — planned")
        ("Trips · expenses · votes<br/>auth · receipt storage")

    ("**Who it is for**")
      ("Groups of 2–6<br/>friends, family, students")
      ("The trip organiser<br/>who absorbs all the work")
      ("Local businesses with<br/>unsold same-day capacity")

    ("**Why now / why us**")
      ("Inspiration already lives<br/>in social video")
      ("Existing planners assume the<br/>decision is already made")
      ("Prices move daily; group<br/>chats take days")
